      "text": "Boquete to Bocas del Toro"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:49b18e3fb3f9ec7b",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d7d829574c14fe16c4900ad4575919979645b68261853979ac8175997896446c",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-translator-20261110-da7adf1e0510432f",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer from Boquete to Almirante. The drive through the mountains takes about four hours.\n\nOn the way, we stop at Los Cangilones de Gualaca, a natural swimming hole. We then cross the Talamanca mountain range, with views of the Palo Seco reserve and the La Fortuna Dam along the way.\n\nIn Almirante, your driver will drop you off at the pier. From there, take a water taxi to the islands of the Bocas del Toro archipelago."
    },
